pin","去转盘":"Spin","已经抽过了":"You already spun","还没抽":"Not spun","中奖人":"Winner","指定必领":"Guaranteed claim","实物":"Gift","调整积分":"Adjust points","积分已调整":"Points updated","改等级":"Change level","修改会员等级":"Change member level","虚拟用户池":"Sample people","生成虚拟用户":"Create sample people","虚拟报名人数":"Sample joins","本团虚拟报名":"Sample joins on this trip","从虚拟用户池抽人占座，之后仍可在列表里改人数。":"Sample people fill seats. You can still change the number in the list.","用虚拟用户给本团所属线路写评价。优先用本团已占座的虚拟报名。":"Sample people write reviews for this route, preferring those already seated on this trip.","成本":"Cost","利润":"Profit","结算":"Settle","已结算":"Settled","待分账":"To split","分账":"Split","公司挂账":"Company tab","活动成本":"Activity cost","保底价":"Floor price","阶梯价":"Price steps","人数阶梯价":"Price by headcount","成团人数":"Minimum group","最低成团":"Minimum to run","最低成团人数":"Minimum to run","已成团":"Confirmed to run","待成团":"Waiting for enough people","铁定出发":"This one will run","已成团 · 铁定出发":"Confirmed · this one will run","解散":"Cancel the group","解散拼团":"Cancel the group","解散理由":"Reason","确认解散":"Confirm cancel","该拼团已解散":"This group was cancelled","显示已解散":"Show cancelled","拼团":"Group","开团":"Open a group","已开团":"Opened","正式开团":"Confirm the group","已经正式开团":"The group is confirmed","未开":"Not open","招募中":"Recruiting","进行中":"In progress","已结束":"Finished","已出发":"Left","未出发":"Not left","出行":"Trip","出行次数":"Trips taken","出行评价":"Trip review","出行保险":"Trip insurance","出行天气":"Weather","出行名单":"Who's going","行后":"After","行前":"Before","多日":"Multi-day","一日":"One day","两日":"Two days","三日":"Three days","当天往返":"Day trip","含早":"Breakfast included","用餐":"Meals","餐食":"Meals","门票":"Tickets","住宿":"Stay","交通":"Transport","司机":"Driver","领队费":"Guide fee","平台":"Platform","同意并继续":"Agree and continue","我已阅读并同意":"I have read and agree","用户协议":"Terms","隐私政策":"Privacy","关于":"About","版本":"Version","检查更新":"Check for updates","清除缓存":"Clear cache","深色":"Dark","浅色":"Light","字体":"Font","字号":"Size","小":"Small","中":"Medium","大":"Large","特大":"Larger","拖动上方滑块，调整字号大小":"Drag the slider to change text size","山里信号不好时，文字模式只留行程信息。":"Text mode keeps the trip facts when the signal is weak.","集合时间、地点和还缺几人会更大，封面图先收起来。":"Time, meeting point, and open seats get larger. Covers stay hidden.","同行者众":"同行者众","建议":"Feedback","投票":"Vote","已投":"Voted","类型":"Type","成人":"Adult","儿童":"Child","车头":"Front","内容":"Content","跑团":"Running club","品牌":"Brand","可享":"Includes","团型":"Trip type","出发":"Depart","地区":"Area","身份":"Identity","学号":"Student ID","请先":"First","用途":"Use","不选":"Skip","人起":"min","已报":"Joined","观看":"Watch","一句话":"One line","选座位":"Pick seats","报名前":"Before joining","报名后":"After joining","项权益":"perks","全价团":"Full price","已评价":"Reviewed","已付款":"Paid","副标题":"Subtitle","拟出行":"Planning to go","已参与":"Joined","关注的":"Following","跨学校":"Across schools","加一档":"Add a step","不含：":"Not included:","注意：":"Note:","提交评选":"Submit picks","打开分享":"Open share","报名身份":"Who's joining","车上加购":"Add on the bus","团体名称":"Group name","其他方式":"Other","本团抽奖":"This trip's draw","意见反馈":"Feedback","平台规则":"Platform rules","组织类型":"Organization","学校名称":"School","选择学校":"Choose a school","选择学院":"Choose a college","选择专业":"Choose a major","核验状态":"Check-in","人数上限":"Cap","保存备选":"Save backups","本团评价":"Reviews","保存图片":"Save image","用车照片":"Vehicle photos","提现时间":"When it arrives","到账时间":"Arrival time","单笔额度":"Per transfer","其他说明":"Other notes","校园范围":"Who on campus","开放组合":"Open combination","全部天数":"Any length","装备清单":"Gear list","已完成活动":"Finished","已有账号？":"Already have an account?","还没有账号？":"No account yet?","怎么称呼你":"What should we call you","返回团详情":"Back to the trip","改完再申请":"Edit it, then apply again","开放该组合":"Open this combination","本局微信群":"Group chat","本团咨询群":"Trip group","官方用户群":"Official group","行程分享图":"Trip card","报名二维码":"Join QR code","本局群二维码":"Group QR code","本团群二维码":"Group QR code","已认证校友":"Verified alumni","已认证师生":"Verified students and staff","原支付密码":"Current pay PIN","新支付密码":"New pay PIN","再输入一次":"Enter it again","再输入一次密码":"Enter the password again","本校跨学院":"Other colleges at this school","这档中奖率":"Odds for this prize","可报名排期":"Dates you can join","接收集合通知":"Meeting-point alerts","最少几人成局":"Minimum to run","建议成团人数":"Suggested size","匹配已有线路":"Match an existing route","仅已认证学生":"Verified students only","仅已认证学生组织":"Verified student groups only","发给微信好友":"Send to a friend","确认微信支付":"Confirm WeChat Pay","每日提现次数":"Withdrawals per day","评价领队和路线":"Review the guide and route","紧急联系人手机":"Emergency phone","不成团时的备选":"Backup if it doesn't fill","例如：清华大学":"e.g. Tsinghua University","例如：北京大学":"e.g. Peking University","家人或同伴姓名":"Family or friend's name","暂无在岗导游。":"No guide on duty.","请输入上图字符":"Type the characters in the picture","学生或学生组织":"Student or student group","通过后客服加你":"Support adds you after approval","邀请代付或分摊":"Ask someone to pay or split","联系官方与本团":"Official and this trip","学生证上的学号":"Student ID on the card","账户安全保障中":"Securing the account","充值金额（元）":"Top-up amount (CNY)","提现金额（元）":"Amount (CNY)","确认提现到微信":"Confirm withdrawal to WeChat","与实名信息一致":"Must match your verified name","不限制学校学院":"Any school or college","允许已认证校友":"Verified alumni can join","已记入你的账户":"Added to your account","带队时展示给团友":"Shown to the group when you lead","没有带过可填 0":"Enter 0 if you haven't led","还没有历史报名。":"No past joins.","还没有过往行程。":"No past trips.","还没有关注线路。":"No saved routes.","还没有钱包流水。":"No wallet activity yet.","一句话卖点，可空":"One-line pitch, optional","本团已解散。理由：":"This trip was cancelled. Reason:","本次支付金额（元）":"Amount (CNY)","户外线路（上首页）":"Outdoor routes (on Home)","同城局（上活动 Tab）":"City plans (Activities tab)","完成活动 / 评选":"Finish / picks","评选 · 分享投票":"Picks · share and vote","学生证 / 校友证":"Student or alumni card","可选，搜索北京高校":"Optional, search Beijing schools","可选，例如北京大学":"Optional, e.g. Peking University","会员额外 95 折":"Members get an extra 5% off","不能与出行人同一号码":"Can't be the traveler's own number","看不清请点击图片刷新":"Tap the picture if it's hard to read","例如：慕田峪长城一日":"e.g. a Mutianyu day trip","例如：某某大学登山队":"e.g. a university hiking club","随发团自动出现在首页":"Shows on Home when you publish","参考价（元 / 人）":"Guide price (CNY / person)","走哪、看什么、适合谁":"Where, what you'll see, and who it's for","暂无即将出发的行程。":"Nothing coming up.","暂时没有即将出发的行程。":"Nothing coming up.","设置 6 位支付密码":"Set a 6-digit pay PIN","这次出行怎么样（选填）":"How was the trip? (optional)","保险另计，不参与优惠。":"Insurance is extra and isn't discounted.","组合团 · 另一半条件":"Paired group · who you hope to meet","需要人时，先加官方微信":"Add the official WeChat if you need people","费用（元，0 为免费）":"Price (CNY, 0 means free)","例如：三里屯太古里南区":"e.g. Sanlitun Taikoo Li south","输入关键词，点下方选用":"Type a keyword, then pick below","摄影师 · 报名摄影师":"Photographer · join as photographer","报超会抽（车位不够才抽）":"Draw only if there aren't enough seats","已报名，待确认出行名单。":"Joined. The roster is still being confirmed.","仅已认证师生（不限学校）":"Verified students and staff, any school","两次奖品一致，领取时翻倍":"The same prize twice pays double when you claim it","例如：想找同校第一次走长城":"e.g. a first Great Wall trip with my school","该报名已取消或拼团已解散。":"This join was cancelled, or the group was dissolved.","带什么、几点开始、怎么找人":"What to bring, when it starts, and how to find people","中奖先记账，跟团结束后领奖":"The win is recorded now and collected after the trip","辅助领队 / 摄影师职责说明":"What the assistant guide and photographer do","已报名。到场时找发起人即可。":"You're in. Find the host when you arrive.","还没有人报名，快来占第一名。":"Nobody has joined yet.","微信支付成功后立即进入余额。":"WeChat Pay lands in your balance right away.","成团后匹配导游 · 先看看领队":"A guide is matched once it fills · meet the guides","报名后按下面金额，出行前支付。":"After you join, pay the amount below before the day.","出发日前可取消；到场找发起人。":"You can cancel before the day. Find the host on site.","4～16 个字，可空则自动生成":"4–16 characters, or leave blank to generate one","11 位手机，方便通过后联系你":"An 11-digit phone so we can reach you after approval","11 位手机号":"11-digit phone","本团咨询群确认后会显示在这里。":"The trip group shows here after it's confirmed.","例如：天气预警、人数不足不成团":"e.g. a weather warning, or not enough people","向发起人要 4～16 个字的口令":"Ask the host for a 4–16 character code","走过哪些线、怎么带队、能照顾到什么":"Routes you've led, how you lead, and who you can look after","现价（可空，早鸟/特惠将按折扣算）":"Price now (optional; early-bird and deals use the discount)","1. 座位图可改座，早报名早选座。":"1. You can change seats on the map. Join early to pick one.","用实名身份证号重置 6 位支付密码。":"Reset the 6-digit pay PIN with the ID number on your profile.","如本团未成团，自动加入相同行程的其他日期":"If this date doesn't run, you move to another date of the same trip","如本团未成团，自动加入相同行程的其他日期（替代团）":"If this date doesn't run, you move to another date of the same trip.","免个人团费，保险另计。本团只设一位摄影师。":"No personal trip fee. Insurance is extra. One photographer on this trip.","车头朝上，中间为过道。不选则自动分配空位。":"The front of the bus is at the top and the aisle is in the middle. An open seat is assigned if you don't pick.","还没有收藏线路，去线路详情点「收藏」即可。":"Nothing saved. Open a route and tap Save.","已成团 · 铁定出发（人数已达最低成团线）":"Confirmed. This one will run.","公开资料不含手机号与精确年龄，仅展示年龄段。":"Your public profile hides your phone and exact age, and shows an age range.","可留空。搜不到时点「使用该名称」即可自己填。":"You can leave this blank. If search misses it, tap Use this name.","还没有评价。报名后可在「我的报名」写下体验。":"No reviews yet. After you join, write one from My joins.","还没有人写下条件。":"Nobody has written what they're hoping for.","链接已复制，可发到微信好友 / 群 / 朋友圈":"Link copied. Send it to a friend, a group, or Moments.","上车再买也行。先加上方便领队清点。费用计入应付。":"You can buy it on the bus. Adding it now helps the guide count, and it goes on your bill.","也可多选候选团，解散后按顺序转团，价格多退少补。":"You can pick backup trips. If this one is cancelled you move down the list, and the price is adjusted.","请打开同行者众小程序，在实名信息页完成微信授权。":"Open the mini program and finish WeChat authorization on the identity page.","报名后可查看本团出行构成，方便判断是否适合一起走。":"After you join you can see who's going, so you can tell if it fits.","个人拼团先报名占座，费用待出行前支付。早报名早选座。":"On a personal trip you join to hold a seat and pay before the day. Join early to pick a seat.","还没有优惠券。公开券可扫码领取，定向券由后台发放到账。":"No coupons yet. Open ones can be scanned. Targeted ones are sent to you.","每天 00:00–23:59（北京时间），全天可申请。":"You can request a withdrawal any time, 00:00–23:59 Beijing time.","账号、规则和常见问题都收在这页。线路详情不再重复写一遍。":"Account, rules, and common questions are on this page.","还没有候补。满员团仍可报名进候补，有人取消后按顺序递补。":"Nobody is waiting. Full trips can still be joined as waitlist, in the order seats open.","成团后系统会按线路类型匹配导游。也可以先了解领队风格再报名。":"A guide is matched from the route type once it fills. You can read the guides before you join.","只对学生或已认证学生组织开放。每人写下希望另一半满足的条件。":"Only students or verified student groups. Each person writes who they hope to meet.","充值走微信支付，提现到微信零钱，可直接付团费。不支持银行卡。":"Top up with WeChat Pay, withdraw to your WeChat balance, and pay for trips from the balance. Bank cards aren't supported.","一次最多选 9 张，相册最多 24 张。点图放大，点角标删除。":"Up to 9 photos at a time, 24 in the album. Tap to enlarge, and tap the corner to delete.","学生会、跑团、品牌等团体需后台认证通过后，才能按团体身份发活动。":"Student unions, running clubs, and brands can post as a group after approval.","中奖后立刻看到奖品和中奖率，跟团结束后才能领奖。奖品可在后台再改。":"You see the prize and the odds right away, and collect it after the trip. Staff can still change prizes.","提交成功后实时转入微信零钱。如遇系统延迟，最迟 24 小时内到账。":"After you submit, it goes to your WeChat balance. If there's a delay, it arrives within 24 hours.","余额用于支付团费。不用时按上方提现规则转到微信零钱。不支持银行卡。":"The balance pays for trips. Withdraw unused money to WeChat with the rules above. Bank cards aren't supported.","勾选报超会抽后，先报名待确认；人数超过座位才抽签，未超过则全部确认。":"With the overflow draw on, people join as pending. Names are drawn only when there are more people than seats.","请保留一档「0 天」，用于出发当天尚未正式开团。正式开团后一律不退费。":"Keep a 0-day step for departure day before the group is confirmed. After that, there is no refund.","解散后将取消全部报名，已付款按各付款人原路退回，并向出行人发送取消短信。":"Cancelling the group cancels every join, refunds each payer the way they paid, and texts the travelers.","报名前抽奖":"Draw before joining","报名后抽奖":"Draw after joining","报名前抽到":"Drawn before joining","报名前和报名后都抽":"Draw before and after joining","开团要求另一半来自":"The other person should be from","使用该名称":"Use this name","学院可空":"College optional","专业可空":"Major optional","请先选择学校":"Choose a school first","请先选择学院":"Choose a college first","请先选学校":"Choose a school first","请先选学院":"Choose a college first","群里好认就行":"Something the group will recognize","播放器":"Player","怀柔":"Huairou","延庆":"Yanqing","昌平":"Changping","密云":"Miyun","房山":"Fangshan","门头沟":"Mentougou","海淀":"Haidian","朝阳":"Chaoyang","通州":"Tongzhou","大兴":"Daxing","平谷":"Pinggu","丰台":"Fengtai","石景山":"Shijingshan","蓟州":"Jizhou","承德":"Chengde","张家口":"Zhangjiakou","秦皇岛":"Qinhuangdao","涞源":"Laiyuan","涞水":"Laishui","围场":"Weichang","赤峰":"Chifeng","崇礼":"Chongli","北京":"Beijing","北京市":"Beijing","天津":"Tianjin","天津市":"Tianjin","河北":"Hebei","河北省":"Hebei","内蒙古":"Inner Mongolia","怀柔区":"Huairou","延庆区":"Yanqing","昌平区":"Changping","密云区":"Miyun","房山区":"Fangshan","门头沟区":"Mentougou","海淀区":"Haidian","朝阳区":"Chaoyang","通州区":"Tongzhou","大兴区":"Daxing","平谷区":"Pinggu","丰台区":"Fengtai","石景山区":"Shijingshan","北京怀柔":"Huairou, Beijing","北京延庆":"Yanqing, Beijing","北京昌平":"Changping, Beijing","北京密云":"Miyun, Beijing","北京房山":"Fangshan, Beijing","北京海淀":"Haidian, Beijing","北京平谷":"Pinggu, Beijing","北京门头沟":"Mentougou, Beijing","天津蓟州":"Jizhou, Tianjin","河北承德":"Chengde, Hebei","徒步":"Hiking","登山":"Climbing","玩水":"Water","亲子":"Family","露营":"Camping","文化":"Culture","看星空":"Stargazing","团建":"Team building","长城":"Great Wall","休闲":"Easy","进阶":"Advanced","漂流":"Rafting","避暑":"Summer escape","滑雪":"Skiing","观花":"Flowers","古村":"Old village","古道":"Ancient trail","瀑布":"Waterfall","森林":"Forest","草原":"Grassland","海滨":"Coast","穿越":"Traverse","近郊":"Nearby","小众":"Off the beaten path","纯玩":"No shopping stops","情侣":"Couples","星空":"Stars","周末":"Weekend","即将出发":"Departing soon","快满员":"Almost full","中秋":"Mid-Autumn","国庆":"National Day","元旦":"New Year","春节":"Spring Festival","清明":"Qingming","劳动节":"Labor Day","端午":"Dragon Boat","过夜一晚":"One night","小长假":"Long weekend","深度出省":"Further out","找一条山野路线，周末就出发":"Find a mountain route and go this weekend","约掼蛋、跑步、看电影也可以":"Cards, a run, or a movie","活动不只户外":"Not just the outdoors","北京周边短途游":"Short trips around Beijing","没团的日期可点「发团」提交审核。":"On an empty date, tap Start a trip to submit it for review.","已满·可候补":"Full · waitlist","已满 · 可候补":"Full · waitlist","报超会抽":"Lottery if overfull","刚刚":"Just now","昨天":"Yesterday","浏览了":"viewed","报名了":"joined","收藏了":"saved","关注了":"followed","开了一场":"opened","评价了":"reviewed","给":"gave","评了":"rated","分":"pts","这条线路":"this route","一位同行":"A traveler","此刻":"Right now","人在逛":"people browsing","人在看":"people viewing","已复制微信号":"WeChat ID copied","测试线路":"Test route","东直门东方银座C口":"Dongzhimen Oriental Ginza, exit C","国贸桥下大巴停靠点":"Coach stop under Guomao Bridge","慕田峪长城缆车一日游":"Mutianyu Great Wall cable-car day trip","八达岭·居庸关长城精华一日":"Badaling and Juyongguan highlights","黄花城水长城徒步一日":"Huanghuacheng Lakeside Great Wall hike","司马台长城 + 古北水镇一日":"Simatai Great Wall and Gubei Water Town","十渡拒马河漂流一日":"Shidu Juma River rafting","灵山高山草甸一日":"Lingshan alpine meadow","百花山森林公园一日":"Baihua Mountain forest park","凤凰岭·阳台山穿越一日":"Phoenix Ridge to Yangtai Mountain traverse","延庆龙庆峡一日游":"Yanqing Longqing Gorge","平谷天云山玻璃栈道一日":"Pinggu Tianyun Mountain glass walkway","房山上方山云水洞一日":"Fangshan Shangfang Mountain and Yunshui Cave","怀柔青龙峡 + 雁栖湖一日":"Huairou Qinglong Gorge and Yanqi Lake","密云黑龙潭 + 桃源仙谷一日":"Miyun Black Dragon Pool and Taoyuan Valley","京东大峡谷 + 石林峡一日":"Jingdong Grand Canyon and Shilin Gorge","妙峰山香道 + 涧沟玫瑰一日":"Miaofeng Mountain trail and Jiangou roses","慕田峪 + 古北水镇夜司马台":"Mutianyu, Gubei Water Town, and Simatai by night","十渡 + 野三坡百里峡":"Shidu and Yesanpo Baili Gorge","雾灵山避暑 + 雾灵湖":"Wuling Mountain and Wuling Lake","双龙峡 + 爨底下古村":"Shuanglong Gorge and Cuandixia","金山岭长城星空露营":"Jinshanling Great Wall stargazing camp","涞源白石山峰林云海":"Laiyuan Baishi Mountain peaks and clouds","承德避暑山庄 + 外八庙":"Chengde Mountain Resort and the Eight Outer Temples","蓟州盘山 + 黄崖关长城":"Jizhou Panshan and Huangyaguan Great Wall","乌兰布统坝上草原":"Ulan Butong grassland","木兰围场皇家猎苑":"Mulan Weichang imperial hunting ground","野三坡深度 + 十渡漂流":"Yesanpo in depth and Shidu rafting","秦皇岛北戴河 · 山海关":"Qinhuangdao, Beidaihe, and Shanhai Pass","坝上草原 + 承德皇家行宫":"Bashang grassland and the Chengde resort","五台山朝圣 + 大同云冈":"Wutai Mountain and the Yungang Grottoes","张家口草原天路 + 崇礼":"Zhangjiakou Grass Skyline and Chongli","掼蛋":"Guandan","跑步":"Running","电影":"Movies","招募":"Recruiting","组局打牌":"A card table","夜跑约伴":"An evening run","一起观影":"A movie together","社团招人":"A club looking for people","已解散":"Dissolved","已满":"Full","可候补":"Waitlist open","去候补":"Join waitlist","未报名":"Not signed up","已报名待确认":"Signed up, waiting to confirm","出发日前可取消":"Cancel any day before departure","先报名":"Sign up first","先报名待确认":"Sign up first, then confirm","余":"Left","还缺":"Still need","人":"people","分钟前":"min ago","小时前":"hr ago","天前":"days ago","实名":"Identity","支付":"Pay","注销":"Delete account","查询":"Search","移除":"Remove","上移":"Move up","下移":"Move down","颜色":"Color","金额":"Amount","原因":"Reason","评语":"Comment","分数":"Score","条数":"Count","阶段":"Stage","普通":"Regular","待抽":"Waiting to draw","待领":"Waiting to claim","已领":"Claimed","已抽":"Drawn","已到":"Arrived","未填":"Not filled","可选":"Optional","成团":"Confirmed","退款":"Refund","优惠":"Discount","意外":"Accident","证件":"ID document","组织":"Group","校园":"Campus","师生":"Students and staff","真实":"Real","当前":"Current","理由":"Reason","修改":"Edit","恢复":"Restore","发放":"Send","发行":"Issue","叠加":"Stack","作废":"Void","公开":"Public","限制":"Limit","条件":"Condition","对象":"Audience","紧急":"Emergency","配置":"Settings","手动":"Manual","审批":"Review","剩余":"Left","图片":"Photo","链接":"Link","确认":"Confirm","暂无":"None yet","未知":"Unknown","北京华创科技有限公司":"Beijing Huachuang Technology","行程详情":"Trip","局详情":"Plan","时间、地点、还缺几人":"Time, place, and seats left","本团":"This trip","山野可加购意外险":"Optional accident cover for the mountains","多云":"Cloudy","晴":"Sunny","小雨":"Light rain","风":"wind","小团":"Small group","中巴":"Minibus","含：":"Includes:","车费":"Transport","运动鞋":"Trainers","注意安全":"Stay safe","天气适宜出行，仍请关注临出发预报":"Good weather for the trip. Still check the forecast before you leave.","已过出发日，不可取消":"The departure date has passed, so this can't be cancelled","正式开团后：不退费":"No refund after the trip is confirmed","正式开团后不可取消":"Can't cancel after the trip is confirmed","按距出发日比例退费：10 天前退 100%，3 天前退 80%，不足 3 天退 50%；正式开团后不退费。":"Refund by how close departure is: 100% from 10 days out, 80% from 3 days out, 50% inside 3 days. No refund after the trip is confirmed.","出发前 10 天及以上：退 100%。":"10+ days before departure: 100% refund.","出发前 3 天及以上：退 80%。":"3+ days before departure: 80% refund.","出发前不足 3 天（含出发当天未正式开团）：退 50%。":"Inside 3 days of departure, including departure day before the trip is confirmed: 50% refund.","正式开团后：不退费，不可自行取消。":"After the trip is confirmed: no refund and you can't cancel yourself.","各线路公共规则":"Rules for every route","成团与出发":"Forming up and departure","报名与座位":"Sign-up and seats","装备与安全":"Gear and safety","退改":"Changes and refunds","满员可候补。有人取消后按顺序递补。":"When it's full you can join the waitlist. If someone cancels, the next person moves up.","报了名要马上付款吗？":"Do I pay as soon as I sign up?","人不够会不会取消？":"Will it be cancelled if there aren't enough people?","满员了还能去吗？":"Can I still go if it's full?","集合点怎么找？":"How do I find the meeting point?","一定要买保险吗？":"Do I have to buy insurance?","为什么要紧急联系人？":"Why do you need an emergency contact?","官方团和个人团有什么区别？":"How is an official trip different from a personal one?","想把一条线收录进来怎么办？":"How do I get a route listed?","同行者众官方":"togetherbetter official","同行者众户外交流群":"togetherbetter outdoor group","西直门凯德mall北门外":"Outside the north gate of Xizhimen Kaide Mall","丽泽桥西南角":"Southwest corner of Lize Bridge","4. 正式开团后：不退费":"4. No refund after the trip is confirmed","出发前 10 天及以上：退 100%":"10+ days before departure: 100% refund.","出发前 3 天及以上：退 80%":"3+ days before departure: 80% refund.","出发前不足 3 天（含出发当天未正式开团）：退 50%":"Inside 3 days of departure, including departure day before the trip is confirmed: 50% refund.","正式开团后：不退费，不可自行取消":"After the trip is confirmed: no refund and you can't cancel yourself.","以下规则适用于同行者众全部线路；各团行程页的装备、集合点以当次排期为准。":"These rules cover every togetherbetter route. Gear and the meeting point on a trip page follow that departure.","未达最低成团人数前显示招募中；达到成团线后铁定出发并安排领队。":"Before the minimum is reached it shows Recruiting. Once it confirms, it will depart and a leader is assigned.","人数不足或天气封山时，发起人可解散；已付款按付款人原路退回。":"The host can dissolve the trip if there aren't enough people or the mountain is closed. Payments go back the way they came.","个人拼团先占座，费用待出行前支付；公司团由开团方统一结算。":"Personal trips hold a seat first and you pay before departure. Company trips are settled by the host.","也可打开「替代团」：本团未成团时，自动加入相同行程的其他日期。":"You can also turn on a backup trip: if this one doesn't confirm, you move to another date of the same route.","请按行程页装备清单准备；儿童须由监护人确认风险告知。":"Pack what's listed on the trip page. A guardian must confirm the risk notice for a child.","服从领队现场安排；中途退出须告知领队，下撤费用自理。":"Follow the leader on site. If you leave early, tell the leader. The cost of getting down is yours.","发起人或平台解散拼团：全部报名取消，已付款按全额、按各付款人原路退回。":"If the host or the platform dissolves the trip, every sign-up is cancelled and each payer is refunded in full the way they paid.","可以加入候补。有人取消后按报名顺序自动递补并短信通知。候补期间不占座位。":"You can join the waitlist. If someone cancels, the next person moves up and gets a text. Waitlist spots don't hold a seat.","建议购买户外意外险。不购买则出行风险自担。导游端能看到你是否已加购。":"Accident cover is recommended. If you skip it, you carry the risk. The guide can see whether you added it.","添加官方微信后拉入用户群。本团咨询群由领队确认后显示在行程页。":"Add the official WeChat account to join the user group. This trip's group shows on the trip page after the leader confirms it.","个人拼团先占座，费用待出行前支付；公司团由开团方统一结算。会员价在报名时按当时人数档位计算。":"Personal trips hold a seat first and you pay before departure. Company trips are settled by the host. The member price uses the headcount tier at sign-up.","未达到成团人数前显示「招募中」。达到成团线后标记「已成团·铁定出发」并匹配导游。发起人仍可在出发前解散，须填写理由。":"Before the minimum it shows Recruiting. After that it is marked Confirmed and a guide is matched. The host can still dissolve it before departure and must give a reason.","排期页展示集合点与时间，可打开地图定位到具体位置。请提前 10 分钟到达，超时可能无法等候。":"The trip page shows the meeting point and time, and you can open it on a map. Arrive 10 minutes early. If you're late, the group may not be able to wait.","户外活动遇突发情况时，领队需要立刻联系你的家人或同伴。联系人手机不能与出行人手机相同。":"If something happens outdoors, the leader needs to reach your family or a companion right away. Their phone number can't be the same as the traveler's.","在「我的」申请收录线路，留下手机和微信。客服微信是「同行者众」。审核通过后会出现在线路目录。发团仍走首页「发团」，和收录不是同一件事。":"From Me, ask to list a route and leave a phone number and WeChat. Support WeChat is 同行者众. After review it shows in the route list. Starting a trip is still the Start a trip button on Home.","平台官方团，出行前一天会并入同集合点未成团的个人/公司/高校团。":"Official trip. The day before departure, unconfirmed personal, company, and campus trips with the same meeting point are merged in.","天气、景区封山等不可抗力导致无法出行时，由发起人解散或改期，已收款按解散规则处理。":"If weather or a mountain closure makes the trip impossible, the host dissolves or reschedules it and payments follow the dissolve rules.","一个团最多两位领队。还没有领队时可在行程页点「报名领队」。":"A trip has at most two leaders. If there isn't one yet, tap Join as guide on the trip page.","报名后可勾选多个候选团：本团未成团时，按你选的顺序自动转到别的团，价格多退少补。":"After you sign up you can pick backup trips. If this one doesn't confirm, you move down your list and the price is adjusted.","一个团一位摄影师。还没有时可在行程页点「报名摄影师」，免个人团费（保险另计）。":"Each trip has one photographer. If there isn't one, tap Join as photographer on the trip page. Your trip fee is waived; insurance is separate.","早报名早选座。报名前点座位图会提示先报名；报名后可在座位图改座。":"Earlier sign-ups pick seats first. Tapping the seat map before you sign up asks you to sign up. After that you can change seats.","候补未递补前取消，不影响在团人数。已付款按当时比例、按各付款人原路退回（演示立即记账；真收款需商户退款证书）。":"Cancelling while still on the waitlist doesn't change the headcount. Payments are refunded at the rate then in effect, back the way each person paid.","早报名早选座。报名前点空位会提示先报名；占用位可看个人主页。":"Earlier sign-ups pick seats first. Tapping an empty seat before you join asks you to sign up. Occupied seats open that person's profile.","团详情分段":"Trip sections","本团还有空位":"Open roles on this trip","空位，点此带这团":"Open spot. Tap to lead this trip.","报名摄影师":"Join as photographer","空位，免个人团费":"Open spot. No personal trip fee.","待评价":"To review","最近看过":"Recently viewed","常用报名人":"Saved travelers","关注领队":"Following","报名人":"Travelers","关注":"Follow","已关注":"Following","取消关注":"Unfollow","存为常用报名人":"Save traveler","都读过了":"All read","没有待支付的报名。":"Nothing waiting for payment.","回来的行程都评过了。":"You've reviewed the trips you've been on.","还没有退款记录。":"No refunds yet.","还没有退款记录。取消后会写在这里：退回余额或原路退回微信。":"No refunds yet. After you cancel, this shows whether the money went back to your balance or to WeChat.","成团、集合点变更、审核结果和退款到账会出现在这里。":"Group confirmation, meeting-point changes, review results, and refunds show up here.","还没有看过的线路。打开一条线路后会出现在这里。":"No routes viewed yet. Open a route and it will show up here.","报名时点「存为常用」，下次可以点一下带入。":"On the sign-up form, tap Save traveler. Next time you can fill it in with one tap.","在别人的主页点「关注」。对方再发团时，消息里会提醒你。":"Tap Follow on someone's profile. When they publish a trip, you'll get a message.","还没有即将出发的团":"No upcoming trip","下一团":"Next trip","称呼":"Name","紧急联系人（选填）":"Emergency contact (optional)","紧急联系人手机（选填）":"Emergency phone (optional)","已存为常用报名人":"Saved as a traveler","已退回余额":"Refunded to balance","已原路退回微信":"Refunded to WeChat","退款到账":"Refund received","集合点已变更":"Meeting point changed","关注的人发团了":"Someone you follow published a trip","发团已通过":"Your trip was approved","线路已通过":"Route approved","线路未通过":"Route not approved","校园认证已通过":"Campus verification approved","校园认证未通过":"Campus verification not approved","团体认证已通过":"Group verification approved","团体认证未通过":"Group verification not approved","领队申请已通过":"Guide application approved","领队申请未通过":"Guide application not approved"};
var MIXED = ["认证时请上传学生证或校友证。学校、学院、专业可从北京高校名单里选，也可以不填。通过后可走学生价；部分团只对本院、本校或指定学校学院开放。校友不享受学生价。","在「我的」申请收录线路，留下手机和微信。客服微信是「同行者众」。审核通过后会出现在线路目录。发团仍走首页「发团」，和收录不是同一件事。","未达到成团人数前显示「招募中」。达到成团线后标记「已成团·铁定出发」并匹配导游。发起人仍可在出发前解散，须填写理由。","候补未递补前取消，不影响在团人数。已付款按当时比例、按各付款人原路退回（演示立即记账；真收款需商户退款证书）。","按距出发日比例退费：10 天前退 100%，3 天前退 80%，不足 3 天退 50%；正式开团后不退费。","个人拼团先占座，费用待出行前支付；公司团由开团方统一结算。会员价在报名时按当时人数档位计算。","排期页展示集合点与时间，可打开地图定位到具体位置。请提前 10 分钟到达，超时可能无法等候。","户外活动遇突发情况时，领队需要立刻联系你的家人或同伴。联系人手机不能与出行人手机相同。","天气、景区封山等不可抗力导致无法出行时，由发起人解散或改期，已收款按解散规则处理。","报名后可勾选多个候选团：本团未成团时，按你选的顺序自动转到别的团，价格多退少补。","注销后账号信息将被删除，未出行的报名会取消。同一手机号可以重新注册。确定注销？","一个团一位摄影师。还没有时可在行程页点「报名摄影师」，免个人团费（保险另计）。","解散后将取消全部报名，已付款按各付款人原路退回，并向出行人发送取消短信。","以下规则适用于同行者众全部线路；各团行程页的装备、集合点以当次排期为准。","可以加入候补。有人取消后按报名顺序自动递补并短信通知。候补期间不占座位。","请保留一档「0 天」，用于出发当天尚未正式开团。正式开团后一律不退费。","发起人或平台解散拼团：全部报名取消，已付款按全额、按各付款人原路退回。","勾选报超会抽后，先报名待确认；人数超过座位才抽签，未超过则全部确认。","建议购买户外意外险。不购买则出行风险自担。导游端能看到你是否已加购。","中奖后立刻看到奖品和中奖率，跟团结束后才能领奖。奖品可在后台再改。","提交成功后实时转入微信零钱。如遇系统延迟，最迟 24 小时内到账。","余额用于支付团费。不用时按上方提现规则转到微信零钱。不支持银行卡。","学生会、跑团、品牌等团体需后台认证通过后，才能按团体身份发活动。","平台官方团，出行前一天会并入同集合点未成团的个人/公司/高校团。","早报名早选座。报名前点座位图会提示先报名；报名后可在座位图改座。","一次最多选 9 张，相册最多 24 张。点图放大，点角标删除。","未达最低成团人数前显示招募中；达到成团线后铁定出发并安排领队。","也可打开「替代团」：本团未成团时，自动加入相同行程的其他日期。","添加官方微信后拉入用户群。本团咨询群由领队确认后显示在行程页。","用虚拟用户给本团所属线路写评价。优先用本团已占座的虚拟报名。","成团后系统会按线路类型匹配导游。也可以先了解领队风格再报名。","只对学生或已认证学生组织开放。每人写下希望另一半满足的条件。","充值走微信支付，提现到微信零钱，可直接付团费。不支持银行卡。","人数不足或天气封山时，发起人可解散；已付款按付款人原路退回。","早报名早选座。报名前点空位会提示先报名；占用位可看个人主页。","山野团和同城局都会出现在这里，出发前能看到集合时间和地点。","官方线路。点进去看介绍，有排期就能报，没有可以自己开一团。","个人拼团先占座，费用待出行前支付；公司团由开团方统一结算。","一个团最多两位领队。还没有领队时可在行程页点「报名领队」。","还没有退款记录。取消后会写在这里：退回余额或原路退回微信。","账号、规则和常见问题都收在这页。线路详情不再重复写一遍。","还没有候补。满员团仍可报名进候补，有人取消后按顺序递补。","出发前不足 3 天（含出发当天未正式开团）：退 50%。","发起一局，审核通过后会出现在这里。户外团请回首页发团。","还没有优惠券。公开券可扫码领取，定向券由后台发放到账。","每天 00:00–23:59（北京时间），全天可申请。","出发前不足 3 天（含出发当天未正式开团）：退 50%","在别人的主页点「关注」。对方再发团时，消息里会提醒你。","点姓名看详情。正式开团前手机号打码，开团后才能拨打。","个人拼团先报名占座，费用待出行前支付。早报名早选座。","请按行程页装备清单准备；儿童须由监护人确认风险告知。","服从领队现场安排；中途退出须告知领队，下撤费用自理。","掼蛋、跑步、看电影，或发个招募。山野线路请回首页。","如本团未成团，自动加入相同行程的其他日期（替代团）","报名后可查看本团出行构成，方便判断是否适合一起走。","成团、集合点变更、审核结果和退款到账会出现在这里。","功能建议或发现问题，直接写下来。登录后才能提交。","集合时间、地点和还缺几人会更大，封面图先收起来。","上车再买也行。先加上方便领队清点。费用计入应付。","也可多选候选团，解散后按顺序转团，价格多退少补。","请打开同行者众小程序，在实名信息页完成微信授权。","登录后可报名、开团，余额也能用来付团费和提现。","从虚拟用户池抽人占座，之后仍可在列表里改人数。","链接已复制，可发到微信好友 / 群 / 朋友圈","还没有看过的线路。打开一条线路后会出现在这里。","等级按出行获得的成长值自动升级，不单独售卖。","公开资料不含手机号与精确年龄，仅展示年龄段。","可留空。搜不到时点「使用该名称」即可自己填。","还没有评价。报名后可在「我的报名」写下体验。","过审的团会出现在这里。也可以先看官方线路。","最近没有待出行。点上面「历史」看过往报名。","免个人团费，保险另计。本团只设一位摄影师。","车头朝上，中间为过道。不选则自动分配空位。","还没有收藏线路，去线路详情点「收藏」即可。","已成团 · 铁定出发（人数已达最低成团线）","报名时点「存为常用」，下次可以点一下带入。","通过后会出现在线路目录。可先加客服微信。","用登记手机号登录，查看已分配的团和名单。","如本团未成团，自动加入相同行程的其他日期","部分团仅限高校，周末进山先看好集合点。","去首页报一个山野团，或去活动页约一局。","暂无已分配行程。人数成团后会自动匹配。","选省、市或县，也可选北京周边 / 跨省","山里信号不好时，文字模式只留行程信息。","出发前 10 天及以上：退 100%。","没有已占座的行程。候补在「候补」里。","这是加密团，报名需要发起人给的口令。","已阅读风险告知与退改说明，自愿参加。","留下联系方式，通过后会出现在线路目录","已提交审核，通过后会出现在线路目录。","组合团只对学生或已认证学生组织开放。","用实名身份证号重置 6 位支付密码。","出发前 10 天及以上：退 100%","已阅读风险告知与退改说明，自愿参加","请先完成学生或学生组织认证再报名。","确认后填写，如 京A·D83001","走过哪些线、怎么带队、能照顾到什么","现价（可空，早鸟/特惠将按折扣算）","1. 座位图可改座，早报名早选座。","出发前 3 天及以上：退 80%。","正式开团后：不退费，不可自行取消。","满员可候补。有人取消后按顺序递补。","掼蛋、跑步、看电影，户外请走首页","发起一局，审核通过后出现在这里。","介绍：带什么、几点开始、怎么找人","公司开团（先报名，最后统一支付）","向发起人要 4～16 个字的口令","没团的日期可点「发团」提交审核。","天气适宜出行，仍请关注临出发预报","出发前 3 天及以上：退 80%","正式开团后：不退费，不可自行取消","上次未通过，可修改后再次提交。","账号、规则和常见问题都在这页。","个人开团（先报名，出行前付款）","高校开团（先报名，出行前付款）","只对学生或已认证学生组织开放。","成团后匹配导游 · 先看看领队","报名后按下面金额，出行前支付。","出发日前可取消；到场找发起人。","4～16 个字，可空则自动生成","11 位手机，方便通过后联系你","本团咨询群确认后会显示在这里。","例如：天气预警、人数不足不成团","还没有收藏，去线路详情点收藏","公司团：先报名，公司统一支付","请先完成学生或学生组织认证。","辅助领队 / 摄影师职责说明","已报名。到场时找发起人即可。","还没有人报名，快来占第一名。","微信支付成功后立即进入余额。","司马台长城 + 古北水镇一日","密云黑龙潭 + 桃源仙谷一日","妙峰山香道 + 涧沟玫瑰一日","慕田峪 + 古北水镇夜司马台","搜长城 / 十渡 / 坝上","暂无排期，可以自己开一团。","免费局，填姓名和手机即可。","拖动上方滑块，调整字号大小","例如：想找同校第一次走长城","该报名已取消或拼团已解散。","带什么、几点开始、怎么找人","中奖先记账，跟团结束后领奖","找一条山野路线，周末就出发","约掼蛋、跑步、看电影也可以","八达岭·居庸关长城精华一日","怀柔青龙峡 + 雁栖湖一日","京东大峡谷 + 石林峡一日","坝上草原 + 承德皇家行宫","官方团和个人团有什么区别？","想把一条线收录进来怎么办？","报名参加后才能完成活动。","